  "title": "Choose an AI agent framework by execution needs",
  "answer": "Start with the work your agent must complete and the state it must preserve. This catalog spans SDKs, orchestrators, multi-agent systems and supporting components; its GitHub momentum order is a discovery signal rather than a framework-quality verdict.",
